{{~!--
The href (and hooks) of a link to the theme's subscription page: « S'abonner » by default, « Se connecter »
with signin=true. The destination, in this order:
  1. the theme setting subscribe_url (Ghost Admin > Settings > Design > Site wide), e.g. /newsletter/;
  2. else a published page whose slug is newsletter, abonnement or subscribe (the theme dresses these
     slugs as its subscription page: page-newsletter.hbs, page-abonnement.hbs, page-subscribe.hbs);
     Handlebars cannot remember a result, so a link looks the page up itself ({{#get}}, one query per
     link) unless its caller already did: a template that shows several links runs that query once and
     passes subscribePages=(the result) subscribePagesKnown=true down to the partials with the links
     (header.hbs, home/hero.hbs and home/subscribe-promo.hbs do);
  3. else Ghost's Portal window (#/portal/signup, #/portal/signin): a site without the page keeps a
     working button.
A link to the page ends with #inscription (the sign-up form) or #connexion (the sign-in form): the page
opens in that state, its first field focused. It carries data-subscribe-page, which app.js reads to send
the other Portal sign-up / sign-in links of the page (e.g. typed in a post) to the same page.
Usage, inside an <a> tag:  <a class="…" {{> subscribe-href signin=false}}>  /  {{> subscribe-href signin=true}}
--~}}
{{~#if signin~}}
  {{~#if @custom.subscribe_url~}}
    href="{{@custom.subscribe_url}}#connexion" data-subscribe-page
  {{~else if subscribePagesKnown~}}
    {{~> subscribe-href-pick found=subscribePages fragment="#connexion" portal="signin"~}}
  {{~else~}}
    {{~#get "pages" filter="slug:[newsletter,abonnement,subscribe]" limit="1" as |found|~}}
      {{~> subscribe-href-pick found=found fragment="#connexion" portal="signin"~}}
    {{~else~}}
      href="#/portal/signin" data-portal="signin"
    {{~/get~}}
  {{~/if~}}
{{~else~}}
  {{~#if @custom.subscribe_url~}}
    href="{{@custom.subscribe_url}}#inscription" data-subscribe-page
  {{~else if subscribePagesKnown~}}
    {{~> subscribe-href-pick found=subscribePages fragment="#inscription" portal="signup"~}}
  {{~else~}}
    {{~#get "pages" filter="slug:[newsletter,abonnement,subscribe]" limit="1" as |found|~}}
      {{~> subscribe-href-pick found=found fragment="#inscription" portal="signup"~}}
    {{~else~}}
      href="#/portal/signup" data-portal="signup"
    {{~/get~}}
  {{~/if~}}
{{~/if~}}